SUMMARY:Lancaster Festival of Voices
DESCRIPTION:Music For Everyone is excited to announce the Lancaster Festival of Voices! Join us for a weekend of choral music\, community\, and singing! Programming includes a special workshop and performance with the Orfeia Women’s Vocal Ensemble\, concerts\, and more!\n\nThe Lancaster Festival of Voices started in 2013 when a group of singers met one night after a choral practice. They saw a need for a platform that could both showcase the power of choral singing as a way to bring the community together\, as well as an outlet to create more opportunities for choral performances. \n\nThis two-day festival is a hallmark of Lancaster’s ever-expanding arts community\, both celebrating and showcasing the power of the voice as a tool of musical expression. The 2026 Festival of Voices will take place on April 25-26th \n\n\n\n\n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/lancaster-festival-of-voices/2026-04-25/
LOCATION:Trinity Lutheran Church\, 31 South Duke Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17602\, United States
CATEGORIES:Community,Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/FOV-2026-Poster.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Music For Everyone":MAILTO:info@musicforeveryone.org
END:VEVENT
