SUMMARY:Covenant Chocolate Chip Cookie Concert
DESCRIPTION:Free Music\, Free Parking\, Free Chocolate Chip Cookies.  Join us for Concert featuring the Laus Deo chamber choir and Ladies ensemble. Reflections of Love will explore a unique facet of love.\n\nThe music for the evening will not only reflect upon human love but will also consider the spiritual realm and different aspects of love. The program presents a collection of both beautiful secular pieces and stunning sacred anthems.\n\nSoloists: Heidi Shannon\, Matthew Palmeri\, Derek Stoltzfus\, Ella Shannon and and Layla Shannon    Cellist: Mandy Sheetz
