SUMMARY:Art Lunch with PCA&D: Zoetropolis 30th Anniversary Special
DESCRIPTION:Join The Center for Creative Exploration at Pennsylvania College of Art & Design at Zoetropolis on Saturday\, May 2nd from 1-3 pm for a zine making event led by local artist and owner of Ninety-One Print Co.\, Rachel Wirick-Yinger! We’ll be collaging\, drawing\, writing\, cutting\, and folding to make our zine creations. Whether you’re a beginner or a zine-making pro\, Rachel will guide everyone through the process of making a one-page zine! All supplies will be provided\, but you’re welcome to bring your own materials to collage. This Art at Lunch is sponsored by the Center for Creative Exploration at PCA&D in celebration of the Zoetropolis 30th year anniversary! \n            \n        \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/art-lunch-with-pcad-zoetropolis-30th-anniversary-special/
LOCATION:Zoetropolis Cinema Stillhouse\, 112 North Water Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/04/Copy-of-Zoetropolis-Zine-Making-Instagram-Post-45.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="Pennsylvania College of Art & Design - Center for Creative Exploration":MAILTO:ce@pcad.edu
END:VEVENT
