SUMMARY:Time For Three at The Trust
DESCRIPTION:This award-winning ensemble defies conventions with genre-bending excellence. Comprised of vocalists Charles Yang and Nicolas Kendall on violin and Ranaan Meyer on double bass\, the uniqueness of the trios instrumentation matches its sound\, blending eras\, styles and traditions from classical to Americana. The trios collaborations with two Pulitzer Prize winners resulted in the Grammy-winning album “Letters for the Future”\, featuring the Philadelphia Orchestra. Charismatic performances on major stages and a commitment to encouraging the next generation of musicians showcase a dedication to pushing creative boundaries and captivating audiences. \n\n\n\n\n    tickets
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/time-for-three-at-the-trust/
LOCATION:The Trust Performing Arts Center\, 37 North Market Street\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Arts & Entertainment
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/02/170180_event_md_501.avif
END:VEVENT
