SUMMARY:SACA Fiesta
DESCRIPTION:SACA Fiesta is an annual cultural celebration that brings together community members\, supporters\, and partners to celebrate Latino heritage while supporting the work of SACA Broadcasting- WLCH FM. The event features live musica\, traditional cuisine\, cultural performances\, and opportunities to connect with community leaders and organizations.\nSACA Fiesta not only highlights the richness and diversity of Latino culture but also serves as an important fundraiser that helps sustain WLCH’s programs dedicated to education\, community development\, and access to vital resources.\nOur theme this year is “The 80’s”- a decade that shaped a generation and continues to influence today’s leaders\, innovators and changemakers. For many\, the 1980’s were not only a time of cultural explosion and bold expression\, but also a moment when the Latino community in the United States began gaining stronger visibility and making meaningful strides in public life\, education\, business\, and the arts.\nAt this year’s Fiesta\, we want to celebrate how Latinos have embraced and contributed to the American cultural landscape\, while also recognizing the opportunities this country continues to offer our community. From fashion to music\, from food to iconic moments in history\, the 80’s will come alive with joy\, rhythm\, and pride. \n            \n        \n                \n            \n                \n                \n    Learn More
URL:https://figlancaster.com/event/saca-fiesta/
LOCATION:Vue De La Lune\, 360 Weaver Rd\, Lancaster\, Pennsylvania\, 17603\, United States
CATEGORIES:Festivals & Annual Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://fig.guide/content/uploads/sites/3/2026/03/Fiesta-Invite-.avif
ORGANIZER;CN="WLCH Radio Centro/ Spanish American Civic Association":MAILTO:CGaldamez@sacapa.org
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR